    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23462" root="شيب" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَائِبٌ</span></b>  [<i>Being,</i> or <i>becoming, white-haired,</i> or
<i>hoary</i>]: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْيَبُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَيْبٌ شَائِبٌ</span> is a phrase like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْلٌ لَائِلٌ</span>, (S,) or like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِعْرٌ شَاعِرٌ</span>: it means <i>Intense
whiteness of the hair.</i> (TA.)

